WEBVTT

00:08:27.586 --> 00:08:30.798
with hits such as "Atlanta"
and "Better Things."

00:08:30.839 --> 00:08:34.552
And there would also be
an upsurge in paid subscriptions.

00:08:35.177 --> 00:08:39.390
All because Landgraf
stopped following the crowd

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:44.061
and instead decided to disrupt
in an inclusive way.

00:08:45.688 --> 00:08:48.691
I would call that
rock-star behavior, just saying.

00:08:48.691 --> 00:08:50.818
(Laughs)

00:08:50.859 --> 00:08:55.948
Now someone else that I think is already
a rock star in more ways than one

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:57.908
is Gareth Southgate,

00:08:57.908 --> 00:09:01.078
the current England men's team
football manager.